# Lab_Source Folder

This folder contains source code and resources for the hands-on labs included in the training.

## Contents

- Lab projects for each training topic
- Source files, configuration files, and scripts
- Any required assets (e.g., sample data, images, binaries)

## Usage Guidelines

- Organization depends on the training, but the recommendation is to keep each lab in its own subfolder (e.g., `Lab1_Audio`, `Lab2_Graphics`)
- Users should follow instructions in the training manual or lab README for setup and execution
- Recommendation is to keep the same structure as ModusToolbox
- Remove obsolete labs to keep the folder organized

## File Naming

- Use descriptive names for lab folders and files
- Include lab number and topic in folder names for clarity


